+
+## Discount codes
+
+Staff create codes with `POST /admin/discount-codes`:
+
+- `code`: 3 to 20 letters, digits or hyphens. Codes are case-insensitive, and
+  are returned in upper case.
+- `percent`: from 1 to 100, off the merchandise.
+- `expires_on`: optional, `YYYY-MM-DD`. The code works until the end of that
+  day, UK time. It can't be in the past.
+
+A code that's already taken is a `409`. The response has the code's `kind`,
+which is `percent` for now.
